It is normal to use the widely compatible legacy ssh keys RSA. And then explicitly  
specify the bit length of 4096. However, I will be using the ed25519 ssh type keys  
because it is more secure.   

Understand the config subcommand on global options
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ git config --help  

See your global config
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ git config list

This is normally your personal workspace or Home or (~)
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ pwd
/c/Users/axruf
Or change directory.
cd "c:/Users/axruf"  

Check and see if you have ssh keys.
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ ls -al ~/.ssh
ls: cannot access '/c/Users/axruf/.ssh': No such file or directory

You need correct email for ssh keys.
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ git config --global user.email
ruffin.biz@outlook.com

Check ssh key types. 
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ ssh -Q key-plain
ssh-ed25519
sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com
ecdsa-sha2-nistp256
ecdsa-sha2-nistp384
ecdsa-sha2-nistp521
sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com
ssh-rsa

axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ ssh-keygen -t ssh-ed25519 -C "ruffin.biz@outlook.com"
Generating public/private ssh-ed25519 key pair.
Enter file in which to save the key (/c/Users/axruf/.ssh/id_ed25519):

axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ ls -la .ssh/
total 14
drwxr-xr-x 1 axruf 197609   0 Sep 26 14:40 ./
drwxr-xr-x 1 axruf 197609   0 Sep 26 14:39 ../
-rw-r--r-- 1 axruf 197609 419 Sep 26 14:40 id_ed25519
-rw-r--r-- 1 axruf 197609 104 Sep 26 14:40 id_ed25519.pub

Check to see if the ssh agent is running.
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ eval $(ssh-agent -s)
Agent pid 441

Add private key to ssh agent for authentication.
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ ssh-add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
Identity added: /c/Users/axruf/.ssh/id_ed25519 (ruffin.biz@outlook.com)

Copy and paste your public ssh key to your GitHub.com personal account under SSH and GPG keys.  
Open web-browser -> www.GitHub.com (log into account)-> click on your picture->  
click on setting-> SSH and GPG keys  
Copy and paste public key.
axruf@axruffin MINGW64 ~
$ cat .ssh/id_ed25519.pub
ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHAlXf2Z8hMF/r6zQHq0NUcvjKgJ1Q30UxzPFb102/Nk ruffin.biz@outlook.com  

